{"id":"6ec45a9f1f2cb632","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-patching-lemma.md","title":"Patching Lemma","display":"Patching Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-patching-lemma","aliases":["93-lem-patching-lemma"],"display":"Patching Lemma","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-df-amalgamation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-patching-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-patching-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Patching Lemma"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd15b0d34ad7970a\" href=\"?note=bd15b0d34ad7970a\" title=\"93-df-amalgamation\">93-df-amalgamation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-patching-lemma---Patching-Lemma\">lem-patching-lemma - Patching Lemma</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span> is a class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebras with the amalgamation property <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathbb K;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathbb K;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_1,\\mathbf B_2\\in\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_1,\\mathbf B_2\\in\\mathbb K\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_i,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_i)\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_i,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_i)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathbb K;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathbb K\\land\\mathbf B_1\\in\\mathbb K\\land\\mathbf B_2\\in\\mathbb K\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_1,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_2,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_2)\n\\to\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\exists j_1,j_2\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(j_1,\\mathbf B_1,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(j_2,\\mathbf B_2,\\mathbf C)\\land j_1\\circ e_1=j_2\\circ e_2\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathbb K;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathbb K\\land\\mathbf B_1\\in\\mathbb K\\land\\mathbf B_2\\in\\mathbb K\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_1,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_2,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_2)\n\\to\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\exists j_1,j_2\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(j_1,\\mathbf B_1,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(j_2,\\mathbf B_2,\\mathbf C)\\land j_1\\circ e_1=j_2\\circ e_2\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This lemma is the local form used in amalgamation and pushout arguments.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-patching-lemma---Patching-Lemma","text":"lem-patching-lemma - Patching Lemma","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"bd15b0d34ad7970a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-amalgamation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathbb K;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_1,\\mathbf B_2\\in\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_i,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_i)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathbb K;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathbb K\\land\\mathbf B_1\\in\\mathbb K\\land\\mathbf B_2\\in\\mathbb K\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_1,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_2,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B_2)\n\\to\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\exists j_1,j_2\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(j_1,\\mathbf B_1,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(j_2,\\mathbf B_2,\\mathbf C)\\land j_1\\circ e_1=j_2\\circ e_2\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1107,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["d611f4ac8b8895ab","bd15b0d34ad7970a"]}